                        "form": "rutilantes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d78737d-a3e3-3f17-8ff6-cb5f0fd720da",
                        "entry_id": "128af4fb-44ae-32fb-a1d2-ce1b440a8506",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est d’un rouge éclatant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd47c045-0aef-47a4-a79a-9d0d3ee6623e",
                                "sense_id": "6d78737d-a3e3-3f17-8ff6-cb5f0fd720da",
                                "text": "La physionomie d’Alfred, ordinairement si grave, si recueillie et dernièrement si abattue, était rayonnante, jubilante, rutilante."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6378bc58-0bff-4922-8899-1ef502021b91",
                                "sense_id": "6d78737d-a3e3-3f17-8ff6-cb5f0fd720da",
                                "text": "Il y a de la pourpre dans l'orgueil des humbles : nul sang n'est d'un rouge plus rutilant que celui des martyrs, il fume de fierté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68a5fc34-bac5-40c5-9117-5a6fddc64617",
                                "sense_id": "6d78737d-a3e3-3f17-8ff6-cb5f0fd720da",
                                "text": "Aux environs de Châteauneuf-le-Rouge (en bordure de la R.N. 7), cette limite est tracée dans des marnes rutilantes qui reposent sur le calcaire de Rognac au Sud et qui supportent les niveaux calcaires subordonnés aux poudingues de la Galante au Nord."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a052dcd8-2dd0-328d-b168-0a14b686fcb0",
                        "entry_id": "128af4fb-44ae-32fb-a1d2-ce1b440a8506",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui brille d’un vif éclat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07dd320d-0237-41fd-a454-0d2aec7f0a0e",
                                "sense_id": "a052dcd8-2dd0-328d-b168-0a14b686fcb0",
                                "text": "Je tourne en rond dans mon appartement en attendant un signe d'elle. […]. J'en suis à faire un brin de nettoyage alors que tout est déjà rutilant, parce que j'ai une femme de ménage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b47db0d-f32c-498a-b4d7-370546b7a8c8",
                                "sense_id": "a052dcd8-2dd0-328d-b168-0a14b686fcb0",
                                "text": "Une rutilante voiture de course."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "914ccdfd-13a4-43a1-92c7-0b53c94f95e2",
                                "sense_id": "a052dcd8-2dd0-328d-b168-0a14b686fcb0",
                                "text": "L’apostrophe était si sotte que l’enfant accabla le Père d’un coup d’œil rutilant."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2589ba77-01ad-373f-98fc-d587042c2d98",
                        "entry_id": "128af4fb-44ae-32fb-a1d2-ce1b440a8506",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie la couleur des vapeurs qu’exhale l’oxyde nitrique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c38c6664-653b-461f-bc11-6956a5cef08c",
                                "sense_id": "2589ba77-01ad-373f-98fc-d587042c2d98",
                                "text": "La nitratation s'opère dans des cuves en grès par 5 kilogrammes à la fois. Il se dégage d'abondantes vapeurs rutilantes qu'on récupère dans des tours de condensation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "75d9a7df-d696-4551-ae96-ce341977cba1",
                        "source_entry_id": "128af4fb-44ae-32fb-a1d2-ce1b440a8506",
                        "source_sense_id": "6d78737d-a3e3-3f17-8ff6-cb5f0fd720da",
                        "source_sense_description": "D’un rouge éclatant",
                        "target_lang_word": "knallrot",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "knallrot",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b40f9e3-c78a-3f38-8a46-582b460cbbe8",
                                        "entry_id": "d59f2a9b-493f-3765-be63-a061e41e8ba1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "intensiv rot"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e42b8c42-728b-4d40-ae3e-bf73a0a84d66",
                                                "sense_id": "5b40f9e3-c78a-3f38-8a46-582b460cbbe8",
                                                "text": "„Lippenstift ist natürlich nicht gleich Lippenstift, für den knallroten Mund muss man regelrecht geboren sein, er steht nicht jeder Frau.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6363c8c-e5db-46fd-9e57-74a4c128701b",
                                                "sense_id": "5b40f9e3-c78a-3f38-8a46-582b460cbbe8",
                                                "text": "„Zwei Tage später war ich von den Kniekehlen bis hoch zu den Schulterblättern knallrot.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "15edcbfd-34c1-47cb-91e8-f3191c8d36c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "128af4fb-44ae-32fb-a1d2-ce1b440a8506",
                        "source_sense_id": "6d78737d-a3e3-3f17-8ff6-cb5f0fd720da",
                        "source_sense_description": "D’un rouge éclatant",
                        "target_lang_word": "rutilant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rutilant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                        "entry_id": "831994e1-892e-3bed-a911-0e27cf2aa607",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Shining or glowing with a red colour or light."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "369ca860-3e4a-4436-9a8c-aef0955856a7",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "[S]tately Hyperion or the lordly ſonne, the moſt rutilant planet of the ſeuẽ, in Lent when Heralius herring enters into his chiefe reign and ſcepterdome, ſkippeth and danſeth[,] the goats iumpe on the earth for ioy of his entrance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7378dd20-6434-4c66-a88b-ef9d434dd546",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "[T]he colour of a Comet ſignifies the Nature of the Ruling Planet. This was of a Fiery Red, but mixed with a dusky Silver colour, which made it look but dim in appearance, (unleſs in clear Nights before the Moon was up, for then it look'd more Rutilant:) and therefore it was likewiſe in this reſpect of the Nature of Mars and Mercury, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c731f71-1ab5-406c-80d0-f5348bebf0e0",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "Thy Candour, which the Opticks Quondam drew, / And o'er the Viſible Ideas rang'd, / Was by the Gore of that Lewd Goddeſs chang'd / To Rutilant Purpureous Sanguin Hue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c117b137-efe8-414e-9607-a76a66e1ed59",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "Nitrous acid. #92;#123; It is nitric acid holding nitrous acid in solution, nearly absorbs its weight from it; then in a rutilant vapour more volatile than nitric acid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c953f524-24dc-472f-9ccf-5211d1ca7487",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "His [Percy Bysshe Shelley's] genius lay outside the general trend of our poetical evolution; he is exotic and unique, and such influence as he has had, apart from the effect on the pulse of the individual of the rutilant beauty of his strophes, has not been very advantageous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8ae70b9-3a34-4d80-b6fa-c95883ff68ff",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "Mother's milk, Purefoy, the milk of human kin, milk too of those burgeoning stars overhead, rutilant in thin rainvapour, punch milk, such as those rioters will quaff in their guzzlingden, milk of madness, the honeymilk of Canaan's land."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63baec14-9074-4f20-ac6a-5156a359d4fb",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "[Jack] Kearns is as rutilant a personality as [Joey] Maxim apparently isn't, and from many of the newspaper stories that appeared in the weeks leading up to the fight one would have thought that Kearns, not Maxim, was signed to fight [Sugar Ray] Robinson."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0124456-b896-4cce-94aa-5b8a0ab717c6",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "She was now 16 and sending off her first radiations and vibrations dressed in Varda's own rutilant colors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9c97751-02ed-4c5e-9cd5-f11a23c5f56a",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "He had a round head as bare as a knee, a corpse's button nose, and very white, very limp, very damp hands adorned with rutilant gems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edeba4cb-a747-4ed5-a22c-484aa14a879f",
                                                "sense_id": "5b3584d4-6fd4-33ec-b0bb-dadaebd8bf2e",
                                                "text": "In their absence, the rosy, rutilant glow of Stone Canyon Road was rendered bogus and counterfeit. Like the period houses that lined the stage streets on Metro's Lot 3, Judy [Garland]'s dream house was little more than a set, a beautiful façade, with nothing, nothing at all, behind it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d2da790-1c3b-4687-96d1-0d0c6ea4a252",
